Package: gridlens
Version: 0.1.0
Section: science
Priority: optional
Architecture: any
Maintainer: GridLens Contributors
Depends: docker-ce | docker.io
Description: Local GUI for GridPACK contingency analysis
 GridLens is a local PySide6 desktop application that runs
 GridPACK Docker containers against regulator-selected project inputs
 and stores run logs, manifests, outputs, and reports on the local machine.
